# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: the ignore rules of this package member: everything `stackra gen` writes stays out of
#          git. The committed contract, stackra.manifest.json, sits at the member root, outside
#          .stackra/. Same rule set as the root .gitignore, repeated so the member folder keeps it
#          when copied elsewhere.
# Boundary: ignore rules only.
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: Stackra ADR 0294 decision 10 (generated output is never authored), ADR 0295
#                     decision 5 (generated tool configs and their root shims)

# everything gen writes: the entry barrels, the tool configs, the gen modules and the compiled
# migration SQL
.stackra/*
# the root shims of the generated tsdown and Vitest configs, for tools that read only the member
# root
/tsdown.config.ts
/vitest.config.ts
# template only: the generated samples are committed so they can be read beside their source; a
# real project drops this line once `stackra gen` runs in it
!.stackra/**
# the tsdown build output; published from CI, never committed
dist/
